            <content>
                
                <text class="align_justified left_indent_0 first_line_indent_24">In accordance with
                    the Law of the People’s Republic of China on the Territorial Sea and the
                    Contiguous Zone promulgated on 25 February 1992, the Government of the People’s
                    Republic of China hereby announces the baselines of part of its territorial sea
                    adjacent to the mainland and those of its territorial sea adjacent to the Xisha
                    Islands as follows:</text>
                
                
